  "details": "I love taking photo prints of friends, but it can get a little frustrating:\n\n1. I might have reached max print capacity and the latest photo I want to print isn't printed because of it.\n\n2. There's a long down time between each print because a player has to wait for a photo to be printed before being able to utilize the camera again.\n\nMy proposed solution is to give players the ability to select images from local folders and printing the selected photos.\n\nThis allows for users to focus on taking photos, and subsequently browse and select photos to upload and print.",
